  "description": "<p>Fedora logs a message like \"Rolling back storage session &lt;guid&gt;\" when it cleans up expired sessions. This can be somewhat confusing because any read operation will create a session that will eventually be cleaned up like this. The log makes it sound like there is something wrong.</p>\n\n<p>Cleaning up expired read-only sessions should not produce an INFO log.</p>",
